{"message":"The net change in the asset retirement liability for fiscal year ended September 27, 2003 is the ending balance minus the beginning balance from the reconciliation table. Ending balance: $7.2 million (source:t3c1n0); beginning balance: $5.5 million (source:t0c1n0). Net change = 7.2 - 5.5 = 1.7 million. This also equals additional obligations recognized (0.5) plus accretion recognized (1.2) = 1.7 million.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"7.2 - 5.5","sources":{"7.2":"source:t3c1n0","5.5":"source:t0c1n0"}}}